353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 227 0 R
/E (Automatic hate speech detection has progressed from lexicon-based methods to deep learning and pretrained transformers. However, implicit hate remains difficult because hostility is often expressed through sarcasm, stereotypes, coded references, or shared social knowledge rather than explicit slurs.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
