380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E (AmpleHate detects implicit hate by modeling the relationship between a sentence and its candidate targets. It uses NER to extract target tokens and applies target-aware attention before classification. However, it relies on English NER, fixed relation injection, and focuses only on target cues while ignoring attack cues.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E ( PhoBERT and Vietnamese Pretrained Models)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
382 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E (PhoBERT is a strong pretrained encoder for Vietnamese text classification. Since it is trained on word-segmented Vietnamese text, word segmentation is applied before tokenization. ViAmpleHate uses PhoBERT-base as the shared encoder so improvements come from target-aware modeling rather than the backbone.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
