538 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1376 0 R
/E (ViAmpleHate achieves the best Macro-F1 and HATE-F1 on both ViHSD and VOZ-HSD.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
539 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1377 0 R
/E (On ViHSD, the improvement over AmpleHate is small: Macro-F1 increases by 0.0027 and HATE-F1 by 0.0036.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
540 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1378 0 R
/E (On VOZ-HSD, the gain is much clearer: Macro-F1 increases by 0.0186 and HATE-F1 by 0.0508.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
541 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1379 0 R
/E (The VOZ-HSD accuracy decreases, but minority-class performance improves, showing that accuracy is less informative under strong class imbalance.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
