546 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1380 0 R
/E (English NER detects usable targets in only about 0.09% of Vietnamese training comments, so the original AmpleHate target-aware pathway is almost inactive.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
547 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1381 0 R
/E (Vietnamese NER plus the target-cue bank increases target coverage to about 18.8-20.0% on ViHSD and 43.0-45.2% on VOZ-HSD.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
548 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1382 0 R
