641 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1457 0 R
/E (ViAmpleHate adapts AmpleHate to Vietnamese hate speech detection by replacing English-oriented target extraction with Vietnamese NER and cue banks.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
642 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1458 0 R
/E (It separates target and attack cues, uses relation-bank attention, applies an adaptive relation gate, and trains with weighted cross-entropy plus contrastive loss.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
643 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1459 0 R
/E (The model improves Macro-F1 and HATE-F1 over AmpleHate and other baselines, with the clearest gain on VOZ-HSD.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
644 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1460 0 R
/E (The ViHSD improvement is small and should be confirmed with controlled multi-seed experiments.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
645 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1461 0 R
